---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Private Airport Transfer Lyon Saint-Exupéry | Fixed Price Taxi Alternative to Grenoble & Ski Resorts | ShipCars"
    description="Book your premium private driver service at Lyon Saint-Exupéry Airport (LYS). Guaranteed fixed price, meet-and-greet service, and comfortable electric vehicle for seamless transfers to Grenoble and the French Alps ski resorts."
>

    <section class="section-banniere-principale">
        <div class="conteneur">
            <h1 class="titre-banniere">Your <strong>Premium Taxi Alternative</strong> at Lyon Airport</h1>
            <p class="sous-titre-banniere">The comfort of a private chauffeur service with a <strong>guaranteed fixed price</strong>, avoiding the waiting time and meter surprises of a regular taxi.</p>
            <a href="/en-gb/#reservation" class="bouton-appel-a-action">Get a quote for my trip from Lyon</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-contenu">
        <div class="conteneur conteneur-texte">
            <h2>Tired of the Uncertainty of Airport Taxis at Lyon Saint-Exupéry?</h2>
            <p>
                The long queue, the stress of the taxi meter running up in traffic, the uncertainty about service quality... Traveling to or from Lyon Saint-Exupéry Airport (LYS) can be exhausting before the journey even begins. ShipCars was created to be the solution: a dedicated <strong>private airport transfer service</strong> focusing on your <strong>peace of mind</strong>, <strong>full transparency</strong>, and <strong>absolute comfort</strong>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-avantages arriere-plan-clair">
        <div class="conteneur">
            <h2 class="titre-section">Your Exclusive Advantages When Choosing Our Private Driver Service</h2>
            <div class="grille-avantages">
                <div class="carte-avantage">
                    <div class="icone">✅</div>
                    <a href="/en-gb/nos-tarifs">
                        <h3>
                            <strong>Guaranteed Fixed Price</strong>
                        </h3>
                    </a>
                    <p>
                        The fare is agreed upon when you book and will not change. You know the exact cost of your transfer, regardless of traffic or unexpected detours. This is our commitment to total transparency.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="carte-avantage">
                    <div class="icone">👩‍✈️</div>
                    <h3>Personalized Meet-and-Greet by your <strong>Driver</strong></h3>
                    <p>
                        No more anonymous waiting. Your <strong>professional female driver</strong> will be waiting for you with a sign bearing your name at the arrivals terminal, take care of your luggage, and drive you to your destination calmly and discreetly. <a href="/en-gb/a-propos"><strong>A human service above all</strong></a>.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="carte-avantage">
                    <div class="icone">⚡️</div>
                    <h3>Superior Comfort in an <strong>Electric Vehicle</strong></h3>
                    <p>
                        Travel in the silence and superior comfort of our <strong>100% electric Nissan Leaf</strong>, equipped with heated seats. With <strong>400 kilometers of range</strong>, we ensure all your long-distance journeys without interruption.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-transferts-ski section-contenu arriere-plan-clair">
        <div class="conteneur">
            <h2 class="titre-section">Specialists in <strong>Lyon Airport to l'alpe d'huez Transfers</strong></h2>
            <div class="bloc-information conteneur-texte">
                <p>
                    Heading to the French Alps? We provide <strong>long-distance airport transfers at a fixed price</strong> to all major resorts, including **Alpe d'Huez**, **Les Deux Alpes**, and Courchevel. Avoid crowded shuttles and long waiting times.
                </p>
                <p>
                    We guarantee immediate departure and a direct, safe journey. This is the ideal transport solution for families and groups of skiers arriving in France.
                </p>
                <a href="/en-gb/nos-destinations" class="bouton-appel-a-action">View Fares to Ski Resorts</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-contenu">
        <div class="conteneur">
            <h2 class="titre-section">The **Private Transfer from Lyon Airport to Grenoble**: Our Specialty </h2>
            <div class="bloc-information conteneur-texte">
                <p>
                    The journey between <strong>Lyon Airport and Grenoble</strong> is our most frequently requested service. We know this route perfectly to guarantee you the smoothest trip possible. It is the perfect ground transportation solution for business travellers and families moving between these two major cities.
                </p>
                <p>
                    To learn more about this specific trip, pickup points, and advantages compared to the train or bus, please consult our dedicated page.
                </p>
                <a href="/en-gb/vtc-lyon-grenoble" class="bouton-secondaire">Details of the Private Transfer Lyon ↔ Grenoble</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    
    <section class="section-faq section-contenu arriere-plan-clair">
        <div class="conteneur">
            <h2 class="titre-section">Frequently Asked Questions about our Airport Transfers</h2>
            <div class="liste-faq">
                <details class="element-faq">
                    <summary>Do your drivers speak English?</summary>
                    <p>Yes, absolutely. All our professional drivers are able to communicate clearly in English to ensure a comfortable and straightforward experience for our international guests from the United Kingdom and worldwide.</p>
                </details>
                <details class="element-faq">
                    <summary>How will I find my driver at the airport?</summary>
                    <p>Your driver will wait for you at the baggage claim exit of your flight terminal with a sign bearing your name. You will also receive a confirmation text message upon landing.</p>
                </details>
                <details class="element-faq">
                    <summary>What happens if my flight is delayed?</summary>
                    <p>We track your flight number in real-time. We adjust the pickup time based on your actual arrival time, <strong>with no extra cost</strong> for the wait.</p>
                </details>
                <details class="element-faq">
                    <summary>Is the fare all-inclusive?</summary>
                    <p>Yes, absolutely. All our fares for airport transfers are <strong>all-inclusive</strong>: tolls, waiting time for flight delays, and luggage handling are included in the fixed price you book.</p>
                </details>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-appel-a-action">
        <div class="conteneur">
            <h2>Ready to Book your **Fixed Price Taxi Alternative**?</h2>
            <a href="/en-gb/#reservation" class="bouton-appel-a-action">Book my Private Driver for Lyon Airport</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    /* --- Styles conservés en français complet pour la cohérence du site --- 
    */
    :root {
        --couleur-accent: #35c2b5;
        --couleur-fond-sombre: #2d3a4c;
        --couleur-texte: #333;
        --couleur-fond-clair: #f8f9fa;
        --couleur-blanc: #ffffff;
    }
    .conteneur { 
        max-width: 1200px; 
        margin: 0 auto; 
        padding: 0 1.5rem; 
    }
    .conteneur-texte { max-width: 800px; }

    h1, h2, h3 { 
        font-weight: 700; 
        color: var(--couleur-fond-sombre); 
    }
    a { 
        color: var(--couleur-accent); 
        text-decoration: none; 
        transition: opacity 0.3s ease; 
    }
    a:hover { opacity: 0.8; }
    p { 
        margin-bottom: 1rem; 
        color: #555; 
    }

    .section-contenu, .section-transferts-ski, .section-faq { 
        padding: 4rem 1.5rem; 
    }
    .arriere-plan-clair { 
        background-color: var(--couleur-fond-clair); 
    }
    .titre-section { 
        font-size: clamp(1.8em, 4vw, 2.5em); 
        margin-bottom: 2rem; 
        text-align: center; 
    }

    /* Styles de la bannière principale (Page Hero) */
    .section-banniere-principale {
        display: flex; 
        align-items: center; 
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 60vh; 
        padding: 4rem 1.5rem; 
        text-align: center; 
        color: var(--couleur-blanc);
        background: linear-gradient(rgba(45, 58, 76, 0.75), rgba(45, 58, 76, 0.75)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591543620788-12c8a2a3a5f4?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop') no-repeat center center;
        background-size: cover;
    }
    .titre-banniere {
        color: var(--couleur-blanc); 
        font-size: clamp(2.5em, 5.5vw, 4em);
        text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .sous-titre-banniere { 
        font-size: 1.2rem; 
        max-width: 700px; 
        margin: 1rem auto 2.5rem auto; 
        opacity: 0.95; 
        color: var(--couleur-blanc);
    }
    
    /* Styles des boutons */
    .bouton-appel-a-action, .bouton-secondaire {
        display: inline-block; 
        padding: 0.9rem 2.2rem; 
        border-radius: 50px;
        font-weight: 700; 
        text-transform: uppercase; 
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        font-size: 0.95rem; 
        border: 2px solid transparent; 
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .bouton-appel-a-action { 
        background-color: var(--couleur-accent); 
        color: var(--couleur-blanc); 
    }
    .bouton-appel-a-action:hover { 
        background-color: #2daaa0; 
        transform: translateY(-3px); 
    }
    .bouton-secondaire { 
        background-color: transparent; 
        color: var(--couleur-fond-sombre); 
        border-color: #ddd; 
    }
    .bouton-secondaire:hover { 
        background-color: var(--couleur-fond-sombre); 
        color: var(--couleur-blanc); 
        border-color: var(--couleur-fond-sombre); 
    }

    /* Styles de la grille d'avantages (Features Grid) */
    .grille-avantages {
        display: grid; 
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem; 
        max-width: 1100px; 
        margin: 3rem auto 0 auto;
    }
    .carte-avantage { text-align: center; }
    .carte-avantage h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .carte-avantage p { font-size: 1rem; color: #555; }
    .carte-avantage .icone { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }

    /* Style de la section d'appel à action finale (CTA) */
    .section-appel-a-action { 
        background-color: var(--couleur-fond-sombre); 
        color: var(--couleur-blanc); 
        padding: 5rem 1.5rem; 
        text-align: center; 
    }
    .section-appel-a-action h2 { 
        color: var(--couleur-blanc); 
        margin-bottom: 2rem; 
    }

    /* Style du bloc d'information */
    .bloc-information {
        background: var(--couleur-blanc); 
        padding: 2.5rem; 
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); 
        text-align: center;
    }
    
    /* Styles spécifiques pour la FAQ */
    .liste-faq { max-width: 900px; margin: 3rem auto 0 auto; }
    .element-faq { 
        background-color: var(--couleur-blanc); 
        border: 1px solid #eee; 
        border-radius: 8px; 
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        padding: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    .element-faq summary {
        display: block;
        padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--couleur-fond-sombre);
        transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }
    .element-faq summary:hover { background-color: #f0f0f0; }
    .element-faq p { 
        padding: 0 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.5rem; 
        margin: 0; 
        color: #555;
    }

    /* Médias Queries pour la réactivité (responsive) */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .section-banniere-principale { min-height: 50vh; }
        .titre-banniere { font-size: 2em; }
        .titre-section { font-size: 2em; }
    }
</style>